2026-07-27T08:50:51.5090461Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:50:51.5091303Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:50:51.5091780Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:50:51.5092404Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:50:51.5092886Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
